    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, AI will destroy the world, and human beings will face a cruel living conditions. You, as one of the few survivors, as a Iron Ranger, have been fighting relentlessly for freedom, for honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Randomly dropped guns, a variety of different levels, combinations of different attributes, each gun has a different shooting feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. It can build a variety of mechanical equipment to provide assistance for combat, and shooting technology and combat strategy provide different experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. All kinds of enemies continue to increase and become stronger, and the large map treasure mode, challenge infinite fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804040/extras/3b6bd74237ff95276dc1069fdd292366.avif?t=1752328649\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804040/extras/29efed0507736196d2898f61102debbe.avif?t=1752328649\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804040/extras/2880abea13984d26ce5b490b3538c19c.avif?t=1752328649\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, AI will destroy the world, and human beings will face a cruel living conditions. You, as one of the few survivors, as a Iron Ranger, have been fighting relentlessly for freedom, for honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Randomly dropped guns, a variety of different levels, combinations of different attributes, each gun has a different shooting feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. It can build a variety of mechanical equipment to provide assistance for combat, and shooting technology and combat strategy provide different experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. All kinds of enemies continue to increase and become stronger, and the large map treasure mode, challenge infinite fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804040/extras/3b6bd74237ff95276dc1069fdd292366.avif?t=1752328649\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804040/extras/29efed0507736196d2898f61102debbe.avif?t=1752328649\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804040/extras/2880abea13984d26ce5b490b3538c19c.avif?t=1752328649\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
